; La Crique: the first real level. Two bases on low cliffs, a beach on each side, a water channel to hop over,
; and a plateau in the middle where the blue crates fall. Symmetric: everything can be crossed both ways,
; carrying a crate included (no ladder on the way between a drop zone and a pad).
; Drops: red at each base (1, 5) and on each beach (2, 4), blue in the middle (3).
name=La Crique
drop.1=red,6,2
drop.2=red,9,1
drop.3=blue,12,1
drop.4=red,9,1
drop.5=red,6,2
